            <ArticleTitle>Endometriosis and pelvic pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>775-89</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The majority of patients with pain associated with endometriosis will obtain benefit from the many and varied therapies available for the treatment of endometriosis. The minority who fail to obtain relief from the conventional therapies may obtain benefit from referral to a pain clinic.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
